   "report": {
    "title": "Plan: The Gutter teaches The Gutter Paint instead of the crafting recipe for The Gutter",
    "description": "This plan should teach you to craft The Gutter, but it teaches The Gutter Paint instead. The Gutter's own crafting recipe (co_Weapon_Melee_DLC01_AssaultronBlade_TheGutter) was left behind: it no longer makes anything and it is unlocked by a deleted record (_DELETE_Note), so there is no way to learn to craft The Gutter. These game checks still look for that old recipe, so they can never pass: DailyOps_AllChaseRareRecipesKnown_Condition, MPE_AllChaseUltraRareRecipesKnown_Condition.",
    "steps": "1. Get Plan: The Gutter (Daily Ops - High Chase Rare / Minerva (Gold Bullion vendor) / Mutated Public Events - Ultra Rare Plans)\n2. Learn the plan\n3. Go to a Weapons Workbench and look for The Gutter",
    "expected": "Learning Plan: The Gutter unlocks crafting The Gutter.",
    "actual": "It unlocks The Gutter Paint. The Gutter can't be crafted, and there is no other way to learn it.",
    "dept": "System Design",
    "cause": "The plan's recipe was switched to The Gutter Paint. The Gutter's own recipe (co_Weapon_Melee_DLC01_AssaultronBlade_TheGutter) now makes nothing and is unlocked by a deleted record. Pointing the plan back at the recipe for The Gutter should fix it. These condition forms still check the old recipe, so they can never pass for anyone: DailyOps_AllChaseRareRecipesKnown_Condition, MPE_AllChaseUltraRareRecipesKnown_Condition.\n\nRecords: Recipe_Weapon_Melee_AssaultronBlade_TheGutter [BOOK:005D0F04], co_Weapon_Melee_DLC01_AssaultronBlade_TheGutter [COBJ:005D9D18], _DELETE_Note [BOOK:0047B7F2], DLC01_AssaultronBlade_TheGutter [WEAP:005E6F9E], co_mod_AssaultronBlade_Weapon_Paint_TheGutter [COBJ:005DAE95]",
    "filename": "bethesda-bug-report-the-gutter-wrong-item.txt"
   }
  }
